{
  "name": "trips",
  "version": "0.7.0",
  "kind": "blueprint",
  "module_directory": "trips",
  "description": "Per-trip ecosystem under spice/trips/<slug>/. Each trip is a flat folder with an atlas note + 5 baseline sections (Flights, Stay, Packing List, To Do, Notes). Hub at spice/trips/Trips.md lists trips as BeaconCards row-layout cards sorted upcoming-first. 'New Trip' button scaffolds the directory tree from a name + dates + location dialog. Per-trip nav buttons auto-discover sibling sections. v0.2.0 MINOR (v0.58.0 FA-6): canonical-vocab adoption per Frontmatter Alignment workstream. Trip Atlas + Trip Board Card templates emit canonical created_at: (ISO+TZ; replaces legacy created:). Trip Atlas attending: renamed to canonical people: (plural wikilink list per canonical narrowing — entity-people is the cross-blueprint canonical key; trips' attending was the legacy semantic narrowing). Discriminator tag trip stripped from Trip Atlas template (functional kanban-card / trip-card / trips-hub tags retained). Trip Board Card temporal date tag stripped. TripNavButtons helper emits ISO+TZ created_at via NEW _isoWithTz method (replaces legacy YYYY-MM-DD HH:mm dateStr). 2 existing rule_fragments declare extends: _canonical-vocab; Trip Atlas rule drops attending requirement + adds optional people requirement + drops trip required_tag. v0.3.0 MINOR (v0.61.0 FA-8): depends_on backlink-panel >=0.1.0; Trip Atlas template grows ## Mentions H2 below TripSectionsCards block — universal cross-blueprint backlink panel via canonical trips: cross-ref reverse query. This cycle: breadcrumb adoption (hub→trip→section ancestors-mode trail with lit:/fm: atoms), collision-free note naming (atlas → <Trip Name>.md, sections → <Trip Name> — <Section>.md), NEW TripSectionKinds registry + section_kind/section/trip/trip_slug section frontmatter, TripNavButtons rewritten on the primary+Go-to launcher grammar, TripSectionsCards now keys on frontmatter, and an applyTripsConformanceHeal install heal.",
  "depends_on": [
    {
      "name": "nav-buttons",
      "range": ">=2.5.1"
    },
    {
      "name": "customjs-guard",
      "range": ">=1.0.0"
    },
    {
      "name": "cards",
      "range": ">=0.1.1"
    },
    {
      "name": "convenience",
      "range": ">=0.1.0"
    },
    {
      "name": "backlink-panel",
      "range": ">=0.1.0"
    },
    {
      "name": "render-safe",
      "range": ">=0.1.0"
    },
    {
      "name": "chrome-bar",
      "range": ">=0.3.0"
    }
  ],
  "customjs_classes": [
    "TripSectionKinds",
    "TripsHubCards",
    "TripNavButtons",
    "TripSectionsCards",
    "TripDashboard",
    "TripsChromeBar",
    "TripEntryList",
    "TripLinks"
  ],
  "files": [
    {
      "source": "templates/Trip Atlas.md",
      "dest": "{{templates_path}}/Template, Trip Atlas.md"
    },
    {
      "source": "templates/Trip Flights.md",
      "dest": "{{templates_path}}/Template, Trip Flights.md"
    },
    {
      "source": "templates/Trip Stay.md",
      "dest": "{{templates_path}}/Template, Trip Stay.md"
    },
    {
      "source": "templates/Trip Packing List.md",
      "dest": "{{templates_path}}/Template, Trip Packing List.md"
    },
    {
      "source": "templates/Trip To Do.md",
      "dest": "{{templates_path}}/Template, Trip To Do.md"
    },
    {
      "source": "templates/Trip Notes.md",
      "dest": "{{templates_path}}/Template, Trip Notes.md"
    },
    {
      "source": "templates/Trip Board.md",
      "dest": "{{templates_path}}/Template, Trip Board.md"
    },
    {
      "source": "templates/Trip Board Card.md",
      "dest": "{{templates_path}}/Template, Trip Board Card.md"
    },
    {
      "source": "helpers/trip-section-kinds.js",
      "dest": "{{scripts_path}}/trips/trip-section-kinds.js"
    },
    {
      "source": "helpers/trips-hub-cards.js",
      "dest": "{{scripts_path}}/trips/trips-hub-cards.js"
    },
    {
      "source": "helpers/trip-nav-buttons.js",
      "dest": "{{scripts_path}}/trips/trip-nav-buttons.js"
    },
    {
      "source": "helpers/trip-sections-cards.js",
      "dest": "{{scripts_path}}/trips/trip-sections-cards.js"
    },
    {
      "source": "helpers/trip-dashboard.js",
      "dest": "{{scripts_path}}/trips/trip-dashboard.js"
    },
    {
      "source": "helpers/trips-chrome-bar.js",
      "dest": "{{scripts_path}}/trips/trips-chrome-bar.js"
    },
    {
      "source": "helpers/trip-entry-list.js",
      "dest": "{{scripts_path}}/trips/trip-entry-list.js"
    },
    {
      "source": "helpers/trip-links.js",
      "dest": "{{scripts_path}}/trips/trip-links.js"
    },
    {
      "source": "content/Trips.md",
      "dest": "{{module_directory}}/Trips.md"
    }
  ],
  "nav_buttons": [
    {
      "id": "trips-hub",
      "label": "Trips",
      "icon": "trips",
      "order": 110,
      "action": {
        "type": "openLink",
        "target": "{{module_directory}}/Trips.md"
      }
    }
  ],
  "post_install": [
    {
      "type": "notice",
      "message": "Trips blueprint v0.1.0 installed at spice/trips/. Open spice/trips/Trips.md and click 'New Trip' to scaffold your first trip. Each trip lives at spice/trips/<slug>/ with an atlas + 5 section notes; per-trip nav buttons auto-discover sibling sections so user-added files get nav coverage automatically. Cmd+R required after this install to load TripsHubCards + TripNavButtons CustomJS classes."
    }
  ],
  "breadcrumb": {
    "types": {
      "trips-hub": {
        "ancestors": [],
        "current": {
          "label": "lit:Trips"
        }
      },
      "trip": {
        "ancestors": [
          {
            "label": "lit:Trips",
            "link": "spice/trips/Trips.md"
          }
        ],
        "current": {
          "label": "fm:name|file:basename"
        }
      },
      "trip-section": {
        "ancestors": [
          {
            "label": "lit:Trips",
            "link": "spice/trips/Trips.md"
          },
          {
            "label": "fm:trip",
            "link": "spice/trips/{fm:trip_slug}/{fm:trip}.md"
          }
        ],
        "current": {
          "label": "fm:section|file:basename"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "rule_fragments": [
    {
      "target": "trips",
      "fragment": {
        "scope": {
          "path_glob": "spice/trips/*/*.md"
        },
        "extends": "_canonical-vocab",
        "frontmatter_branch": [
          {
            "when": {
              "frontmatter": {
                "type": "trip"
              }
            },
            "required_frontmatter": {
              "name": {
                "required": true,
                "type": "string"
              },
              "start_date": {
                "required": true,
                "type": "string",
                "matches": "^\\d{4}-\\d{2}-\\d{2}(T.*)?$"
              },
              "end_date": {
                "required": true,
                "type": "string",
                "matches": "^\\d{4}-\\d{2}-\\d{2}(T.*)?$"
              },
              "location": {
                "required": true,
                "type": "string"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "when": {
              "frontmatter": {
                "type": "trip-section"
              }
            },
            "required_frontmatter": {
              "section_kind": {
                "required": true,
                "type": "string",
                "matches": "^(flights|stay|packing-list|to-do|notes|custom)$"
              },
              "section": {
                "required": true,
                "type": "string"
              },
              "trip": {
                "required": true,
                "type": "string"
              },
              "trip_slug": {
                "required": true,
                "type": "string"
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "target": "trips",
      "fragment": {
        "scope": {
          "path_glob": "spice/trips/Trips.md"
        },
        "extends": "_canonical-vocab",
        "required_frontmatter": {
          "cssclasses": {
            "required": true,
            "type": "list",
            "contains": [
              "wide"
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
